# Per-commit deploy builds, e.g. SleepSphere-8af4ce6.zip. Reproduce one with:
#   git archive <commit> | tar -x -C <dir> && (cd <dir> && zip -r ../out.zip index.html …)
# The checked-in site zip is the exception, since it is what gets dropped on
# Netlify by hand.
SleepSphere-*.zip
!SleepSphere-website.zip
